; AnaMark TUN v2 - a factory tuning that ships inside Fiblo Galactic.
; Generated by tools/MakeTunings.ps1 - edit that, not this.
;
; Bohlen-Pierce: 13 equal divisions of 3/1, the tritave.
; There is NO octave in this tuning. It repeats at a twelfth, so the whole
; keyboard spans far more than a 2/1 scale would - the top keys really do
; reach past hearing, which is what a 128-key map of a wide period looks
; like and not a fault in the file.
;
; Degree 0 is MIDI key 60 at 261.6255653006 Hz (12-TET middle C),
; which is where the plugin anchors a scale's 1/1.

[Info]
Name=Bohlen-Pierce
Author=Fiblo Galactic
Description=13 equal divisions of the tritave 3/1 (146.3042 cents per step)

